- Citation (10):
   - Context: "Both data augmentation and pre-training language models can be costly (10)." -> This is a general statement about the cost of the methods. The paragraph is saying that both the data augmentation (which includes the two methods mentioned) and pre-training language models (which is the domain-adaptive approach? or a general category) can be costly. So (10) is a citation that provides a key limitation or cost factor that the paragraph is highlighting.

